Subject: segment function imprecise
Message-ID: <5mVHIblr_-c.kCeVVPmhAQAJ@seewave.groups.google.com>
Archived-At: <https://groups.google.com/g/seewave/c/5mVHIblr_-c/m/kCeVVPmhAQAJ>
